            <abstract lang="en">
                <p>The present disclosure relates to a lubricant composition comprising (i) the esterification product of at least one alkoxylated polyol, and at least one fatty acid, (ii) one of more additives comprising anti-sludge, extreme pressure agents, viscosity modifiers and antioxidants, and (iii) optionally one or more Group I, II, III, IV or V base oils.</p>
